PCA-SAM source distribution

This package reorganizes the local PCA-SAM experiment implementation into an
MMDetection extension. Model class names and project documentation were updated;
checkpoint parameter paths were retained. CSPC's projection helper was reduced
to the normalization and convolution used by the released configuration.
Checkpoint component loading was made device-independent, and frozen components
are frozen at construction as well as when pretrained weights are supplied.

