SAM-derived code retains its source references to ViTDet, Detectron2, ConvNeXt,
MViT and MaskFormer. Those references identify upstream implementation provenance.

The local source header for the contextual neck credited its author as
杜安然 and was dated 2026-03-18. That source attribution is retained here while
the public project and module names follow the PCA-SAM manuscript terminology.

Modified source files and their pre-packaging SHA-256 hashes are recorded in
docs/source_manifest.json. The original dataset, patient metadata and checkpoints
are not included in this source-only distribution.
